#. ここが…寄宿舎の２階…！？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "*This* is the 2nd floor of the dorms...!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まるで廃墟じゃないか…
#. いや、むしろ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like some ancient ruins...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まるで戦場だ…
#. 爆撃でも受けたような有様だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Or no...it's more like a battlefield. Like a bomb blew\n"
"up here or something...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここは女子トイレだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the girls bathroom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Đây là nhà vệ sinh nữ.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>いくらこんな場所でも…
#. 女子トイレに入る訳にはいかないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even in a place like this...I can't bring myself to go\n"
"in.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここは…霧切さんに任せておこう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'll leave this area to Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
